  "story": {
    "day": 169,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy School Day",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a rainy school morning; the bell didn't ring.",
      "Kaya had arts and crafts; she drew a zebra, koala, octopus, and dolphin.",
      "Later, Kaya enjoyed reading at her desk.",
      "For lunch, they ate curry with chicken, corn, cabbage, and lettuce.",
      "The dessert was a pudding. It was quite tasty, Kaya thought.",
      "Kaya thought, \"I mustn't borrow too many pens.\"",
      "On the playground, some played dodge ball; others were dancing.",
      "Kaya looked forward to weekend plans to climb the bars.",
      "\"We'll go skating,\" she told a friend. \"Skiing won't happen!\"",
      "\"It'll certainly be fun,\" her friend agreed. \"You'll enjoy it!\"",
      "Kaya knew they'll cook spaghetti or steak; she'll heat it up.",
      "\"Just such a small ounce for her age,\" Kaya smiled."
    ]
  }
